<title>MOROCCO: ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ TO COMPETE IN PARIS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ TO COMPETE IN PARIS.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan Hicham el Guerrouj , who has broken two world records within 10 days this year, will compete in the world indoor championships in Paris next week, the Moroccan news agency MAP said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>El Guerrouj has broken the world indoor 1,500 metres and mile records this year.</p>
